WEBVTT

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:09.860
Their main army's finally here.

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:12.480
Why don't you guys get the hell out?

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:15.070
You don't need to tell me. I'm leaving.

00:00:15.070 --> 00:00:17.520
I'll kill a few of them and then hide.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:21.180
What about you, mister?

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:22.850
You're staying?

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:28.930
Why are you fighting?

00:00:28.930 --> 00:00:33.440
You've only been here a week.

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:36.900
You're not fighting 
out of love for the island.

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:39.000
I know this is rude to ask,

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:42.880
but everybody's curious.

00:00:43.570 --> 00:00:47.920
The only reason I fought was because 
there was a battle going on in front of me.

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:50.420
Until now, that is.

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:54.860
That's how I felt when I ended up here...

00:00:54.860 --> 00:00:57.480
I won't lose anyone else!

00:00:57.480 --> 00:01:01.170
Very well. I've fought all I need to!

00:01:01.170 --> 00:01:05.400
Tae... Sasamaru... I just wanted...

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:06.630
I won't let your death...

00:01:07.970 --> 00:01:08.950
...go to waste...

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:12.130
Save this island.

00:01:16.330 --> 00:01:18.640
Now, maybe things have changed.

00:01:19.660 --> 00:01:23.350
I can finally see your faces.

00:01:25.010 --> 00:01:29.360
You're right. I don't 
really like this island.

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:32.200
But it's a good island.

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:34.030
You're here.

00:01:35.190 --> 00:01:37.680
Some wars aren't fought for their own sake.

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:40.110
They're fought for other reasons.

00:01:40.860 --> 00:01:43.990
I guess I've learned that here.

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:47.530
We'll protect this place...

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:49.650
And do everything we can!

00:02:15.040 --> 00:02:20.100
A warrior dies to learn who he is, huh?

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:21.540
Here they come!

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:15.620
There're so many more than yesterday!

00:04:15.620 --> 00:04:17.650
Keep shooting until you run out of arrows!

00:04:26.980 --> 00:04:29.580
The starving soldiers 
are swarming the gates...

00:04:30.050 --> 00:04:34.110
The fastest path to victory 
is forcing them to compete for the spoils.

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:37.190
But there's no time left.

00:04:37.190 --> 00:04:39.090
We need to get back to Sasu by morning,

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:41.710
and get everyone aboard 
by the morning after.

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:43.330
We'll barely make it if we're lucky.

00:04:43.330 --> 00:04:48.090
Anyone who fails to board in time 
will be punished as if they'd fled battle.

00:04:48.440 --> 00:04:51.800
This banquet will end at sunset!

00:04:51.800 --> 00:04:54.320
Until then, compete!

00:04:54.320 --> 00:04:56.130
See who can plunder the most spoils,

00:04:56.130 --> 00:04:58.260
and build the highest mountain of corpses!

00:05:00.560 --> 00:05:01.990
Reporting!

00:05:01.990 --> 00:05:04.490
New enemies at the east wall!

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:05.440
Shit.

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:07.940
The east wall is right next to the citadel!

00:05:07.940 --> 00:05:10.150
Magistrate, send reinforcements now!

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:12.370
Jinzaburou!

00:05:13.300 --> 00:05:16.340
Go defend the east wall for us.

00:05:16.340 --> 00:05:20.720
You owe us for what we did 
during that night attack at Sasu, right?

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:23.960
Now we'll be even.

00:05:23.960 --> 00:05:26.340
Guess I'm paying a high 
price for your help, huh?

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:28.260
Some of you, come with me!

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:33.310
East Wall

00:05:31.610 --> 00:05:33.300
Why you...

00:05:34.310 --> 00:05:36.350
Princess, there are too many!

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:37.710
I know,

00:05:37.710 --> 00:05:38.980
but we have to fight!

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:40.470
They're up on the walls!

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:44.450
No!

00:05:44.450 --> 00:05:46.030
Princess, get out of here!

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:46.830
Kano!

00:05:46.830 --> 00:05:47.840
I know!

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:49.430
Wait! I can still...

00:05:49.430 --> 00:05:50.380
Watch out!

00:06:00.060 --> 00:06:00.850
Princess!

00:06:00.850 --> 00:06:01.660
Princess!

00:06:15.370 --> 00:06:16.430
I'm here to help.

00:06:20.500 --> 00:06:21.930
I like the look on your face.

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:24.440
Shut up!

00:06:25.390 --> 00:06:27.590
Princess, your face...

00:06:27.590 --> 00:06:29.450
Your face is all red!

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:31.360
Where's the wound?

00:06:31.360 --> 00:06:33.660
No, I'm not hurt.

00:06:34.270 --> 00:06:35.340
Tears?

00:06:35.340 --> 00:06:37.210
I'm not crying over this!

00:06:37.210 --> 00:06:38.300
Let's go!

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:42.210
South Gate

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:44.310
Are those what they call cannons?

00:06:44.310 --> 00:06:46.170
The gate's coming down!

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:48.790
Everyone, stay at your places on the wall!

00:06:48.790 --> 00:06:51.590
Tatsu, bring the women 
from the rock-throwers here!

00:06:51.590 --> 00:06:54.640
They're already here, Magistrate.

00:06:55.770 --> 00:06:58.560
I knew I could count on you, Tatsu!

00:07:00.370 --> 00:07:01.570
The gate!

00:07:01.570 --> 00:07:03.730
Take the supports off the watchtower!

00:07:03.730 --> 00:07:06.240
Here we go! Pull!

00:07:24.270 --> 00:07:26.990
So they brought down the 
watchtower to seal the gate?

00:07:26.990 --> 00:07:29.020
That will buy us some time.

00:07:29.020 --> 00:07:30.940
Get the women out of here!

00:07:30.940 --> 00:07:31.880
Right!

00:07:33.190 --> 00:07:35.410
Tatsu, go with them.

00:07:39.690 --> 00:07:42.730
I-I'll stay with you.

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:46.590
They'll need a skilled leader 
to escape past the Mongols.

00:07:46.590 --> 00:07:47.290
Go!

00:07:47.290 --> 00:07:49.110
I...

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:52.100
I want to stay with you, Magistrate.

00:07:53.660 --> 00:07:55.680
Don't worry, Tatsu.

00:07:55.680 --> 00:07:57.990
We'll flee the castle, too, 
when the time comes.

00:07:58.460 --> 00:08:00.030
Once the storm has passed,

00:08:00.030 --> 00:08:01.540
we can all live together again.

00:08:02.470 --> 00:08:04.800
Magistrate, I...

00:08:09.730 --> 00:08:10.830
The door went down?

00:08:10.830 --> 00:08:11.810
Impossible!

00:08:12.320 --> 00:08:14.680
Tatsu, get out of here!

00:08:22.450 --> 00:08:24.400
Magistrate...

00:08:25.930 --> 00:08:29.030
I want... to stay with you...

00:08:31.790 --> 00:08:32.880
Tatsu!

00:08:32.880 --> 00:08:33.900
The gate!

00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:35.610
The enemy's inside!

00:09:04.200 --> 00:09:05.640
Magistrate!

00:09:05.640 --> 00:09:07.310
Stand fast!

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:09.560
We are the defenders of Japan...

00:09:09.970 --> 00:09:12.830
We came to Kanatanoki Castle,

00:09:12.830 --> 00:09:15.590
and this is where we 
shall lay ourselves to rest!

00:09:19.550 --> 00:09:25.170
Do not let them past my corpse!

00:09:41.070 --> 00:09:43.770
I heard explosions earlier...

00:09:43.770 --> 00:09:45.130
Is the south gate okay?

00:09:49.420 --> 00:09:50.860
The Mongols are inside the castle!

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:51.690
Where did they come from?

00:09:52.580 --> 00:09:53.450
Damn it!

00:09:55.300 --> 00:09:56.120
Amushi?

00:09:56.960 --> 00:09:57.930
Bad news.

00:09:57.930 --> 00:09:59.680
The south gate fell.

00:09:59.680 --> 00:10:02.030
All its defenders are dead.

00:10:02.990 --> 00:10:04.150
Impossible...

00:10:04.150 --> 00:10:05.290
Even Nagamine-dono?

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:06.540
Yes.

00:10:06.540 --> 00:10:07.710
He's dead.

00:10:10.090 --> 00:10:13.240
Now we'll be even.

00:10:13.240 --> 00:10:18.320
So in defending this place, 
I failed to defend the other one?

00:10:19.140 --> 00:10:21.760
<i>I guess I never got to repay my debt...</i>

00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:23.130
Damn it!

00:10:23.130 --> 00:10:26.940
Toibarai, you fought well!

00:10:26.940 --> 00:10:28.970
Damn it!

00:10:28.970 --> 00:10:31.240
Where did the islanders 
inside the castle flee to?

00:10:31.240 --> 00:10:33.760
"Where"? They all split up and ran.

00:10:33.760 --> 00:10:36.010
Kuchii, I'm getting out of here, too.

00:10:36.010 --> 00:10:37.520
Sana's waiting.

00:10:38.210 --> 00:10:39.030
I see.

00:10:39.340 --> 00:10:40.800
I owe you one.

00:10:40.800 --> 00:10:42.490
Though you owe me, too, I guess.

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:44.360
Don't die.

00:10:44.360 --> 00:10:46.380
Yeah, you, too.

00:10:47.470 --> 00:10:48.680
See ya.

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:51.410
They're coming up the walls!

00:10:51.410 --> 00:10:54.320
Princess, we can't hold this position!

00:10:54.320 --> 00:10:55.770
We need to flee!

00:10:55.770 --> 00:10:56.780
But...

00:10:56.780 --> 00:11:01.050
Jinzaburou, can you buy us a little 
more time for the islanders to flee?

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:01.930
No.

00:11:01.930 --> 00:11:04.430
This castle was too big to begin with.

00:11:04.430 --> 00:11:05.890
We gave it all we could.

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:08.130
Now that the walls
 have fallen, it's hopeless.

00:11:08.130 --> 00:11:10.480
Our job now is to get the hell out.

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:11.810
I see.

00:11:12.340 --> 00:11:15.730
Then at least we can guard 
the islanders as they flee.

00:11:17.390 --> 00:11:21.130
I thought you were leaving 
after you killed a few, Hitari.

00:11:21.130 --> 00:11:22.770
That's right.

00:11:22.770 --> 00:11:26.340
But hunting is just what hunters do.

00:11:27.270 --> 00:11:30.620
Get going. I'll leave on my own.

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:33.540
I don't like moving in a pack.

00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:34.750
Got it.

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:35.840
Take care of this place.

00:11:35.840 --> 00:11:36.960
Don't push yourself too hard.

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:38.290
You shouldn't, either.

00:11:38.540 --> 00:11:40.120
Flee!

00:11:40.120 --> 00:11:42.540
Retreat! Retreat!

00:11:42.540 --> 00:11:45.400
Hitari! Next time, let's hit our target!

00:11:45.400 --> 00:11:47.760
Yeah, I won't screw up next time.

00:11:47.760 --> 00:11:48.880
Nor will I.

00:11:50.170 --> 00:11:52.820
Sana, we need to go!

00:11:52.820 --> 00:11:57.570
Amushi, are you sure you don't know 
which way Big Sis Tatsu went?

00:11:58.210 --> 00:12:00.040
I don't know...

00:12:00.700 --> 00:12:04.080
Anyway, she's the one who told you 
to take care of these people, right?

00:12:04.070 --> 00:12:05.280
Don't worry.

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:07.450
Just leave it to Big Sis Sana!

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:09.070
I know a way out.

00:12:09.070 --> 00:12:11.490
But there might be Mukuri on the way.

00:12:12.240 --> 00:12:13.860
Don't worry.

00:12:13.860 --> 00:12:15.830
I've got this if we need it.

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:19.250
I stole it from a Mongol 
camp a few days ago.

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:21.600
If I see any Mongols, 
I'll throw it in their faces.

00:12:21.960 --> 00:12:23.970
Now, let's get going.

00:12:23.970 --> 00:12:24.830
Yeah.

00:12:25.690 --> 00:12:27.850
Can we flee from the northeast inlet?

00:12:27.850 --> 00:12:31.010
The inlet may have already fallen.

00:12:31.010 --> 00:12:35.310
But if we try to flee into the mountains, 
we'll run into a sheer cliff!

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:38.310
They're coming from below!

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:41.880
Sheer cliff or no, we should be able 
to find a way down if we're careful.

00:12:41.880 --> 00:12:42.730
What?

00:12:42.730 --> 00:12:44.900
You guys head up the mountains.

00:12:45.260 --> 00:12:46.780
I'll slow them down.

00:12:47.610 --> 00:12:50.630
This is my chance to pay back Nagamine.

00:12:50.630 --> 00:12:52.210
Don't be stupid!

00:12:52.210 --> 00:12:54.600
You can't stop them all on your own!

00:12:54.600 --> 00:12:57.250
Are you trying to repay your debt by dying?

00:12:57.250 --> 00:12:58.100
I'm sorry, ma'am.

00:12:58.570 --> 00:13:00.920
K-Kano, let me go!

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:01.710
Kano!

00:13:01.710 --> 00:13:03.210
Get the princess to the mountains.

00:13:03.620 --> 00:13:06.230
Exile... No...

00:13:06.230 --> 00:13:08.250
Kuchii Jinzaburou-dono!

00:13:09.540 --> 00:13:11.050
We are in your debt!

00:13:13.550 --> 00:13:15.150
Let me go!

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:17.320
Jinzaburou!

00:13:17.320 --> 00:13:19.540
I still...

00:13:19.540 --> 00:13:22.820
need you alive!

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:24.750
Jinzaburou!

00:13:27.830 --> 00:13:30.750
Mister, we'll stay with you.

00:13:30.750 --> 00:13:35.410
Even here in the forest, 
the sun god is watching.

00:13:35.780 --> 00:13:37.560
Look over there.

00:13:37.560 --> 00:13:41.420
This island worships 
a sun god called Tendou Houshi.

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:45.010
And our sun god is 
much stronger than others.

00:13:45.800 --> 00:13:46.760
I see.

00:13:47.230 --> 00:13:51.800
Then he will not abandon you or Tsushima!

00:14:12.460 --> 00:14:13.460
Hey.

00:14:13.460 --> 00:14:15.130
Why did you come back?

00:14:15.130 --> 00:14:16.700
Did you forget something?

00:14:16.700 --> 00:14:18.110
Sure did.

00:14:18.110 --> 00:14:23.470
I decided I was gonna rip the skin 
off your face and put it on my mast.

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:28.430
But I can't use an empty 
shell of a face like that.

00:14:28.950 --> 00:14:32.770
What happened to the face 
of the Kuchii Jinzaburou I know?

00:14:33.220 --> 00:14:36.660
To the beast of a man I know?!

00:14:37.450 --> 00:14:38.830
What about you?

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:41.600
You came back instead 
of abandoning the island.

00:14:41.600 --> 00:14:43.870
Did your monster fangs fall out?

00:14:45.210 --> 00:14:46.910
I'm still me.

00:14:47.420 --> 00:14:50.880
If other people look different 
to you, Onitakemaru,

00:14:51.360 --> 00:14:54.170
it means your own heart has changed

00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:56.380
after you came to this island.

00:14:58.340 --> 00:14:59.650
Shut up.

00:14:59.650 --> 00:15:00.630
Ready for a fight?

00:15:02.030 --> 00:15:03.440
Try it!

00:15:34.470 --> 00:15:35.960
W-Wow...

00:15:36.690 --> 00:15:39.700
That's the Sun God of Tsushima for you.

00:15:39.700 --> 00:15:41.740
Let's do our part, too!

00:15:41.740 --> 00:15:44.390
One arrow from a bow 
saves the life of one of our people!

00:15:44.390 --> 00:15:47.380
Two stabs of a spear saves two lives!

00:15:52.190 --> 00:15:54.980
I think it's time to go.

00:15:58.280 --> 00:15:59.930
Is that you, Douen?

00:15:59.930 --> 00:16:01.000
What are you doing?

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:03.030
Oh, I'm...

00:16:03.560 --> 00:16:07.230
I came here with my patients 
fleeing the cannons.

00:16:07.860 --> 00:16:10.720
Those tubes that use fire to shoot stones?

00:16:10.720 --> 00:16:14.770
They're probably using the ones 
who are too weak to move as target practice.

00:16:15.250 --> 00:16:16.520
It makes me sick.

00:16:16.520 --> 00:16:19.380
Anyway, our only choice is to run.

00:16:21.680 --> 00:16:25.380
Some of the Mongols are taking 
another path up the mountain!

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:26.720
I'm sure they are.

00:16:26.720 --> 00:16:29.540
We can only fight a few of them here.

00:16:29.540 --> 00:16:30.940
Damn it!

00:16:30.940 --> 00:16:34.040
Just hang in there until we can get here.

00:16:34.040 --> 00:16:37.190
Jinzaburou, get going!

00:16:37.190 --> 00:16:39.210
I'll take over here.

00:16:39.680 --> 00:16:41.720
Where did this come from?

00:16:41.720 --> 00:16:45.990
The idea of fighting in the same 
place as you just makes me sick!

00:16:46.590 --> 00:16:50.000
You're fighting for the islanders, right?

00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:53.060
If that Buddha's face 
of yours is the real thing,

00:16:53.060 --> 00:16:56.300
then keep it until the end!

00:16:58.080 --> 00:16:59.180
Yeah?

00:16:59.180 --> 00:17:00.950
Then I'll let you handle this.

00:17:03.560 --> 00:17:06.960
I'm not fighting for the islanders.

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:10.330
I'm fighting for those who fight by my side.

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:14.270
Onitakemaru, don't you 
get yourself killed, either.

00:17:15.350 --> 00:17:16.500
Half of you, come with me!

00:17:16.500 --> 00:17:17.880
We're heading up the mountain!

00:17:17.880 --> 00:17:18.910
Right!

00:17:21.740 --> 00:17:25.190
You've changed. I haven't.

00:17:29.280 --> 00:17:32.600
Was that the wolf?

00:17:33.490 --> 00:17:37.100
Hey. You're the guy 
who was at the beach at Sasu.

00:17:37.650 --> 00:17:40.150
The leader of the Mongols.

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:46.120
You're the monster who was with the wolf.

00:17:46.610 --> 00:17:49.450
Would you try and fail again to defeat me?

00:17:50.990 --> 00:17:53.750
You're blabbing about something again.

00:17:53.750 --> 00:17:57.080
I've been waiting for a chance to kill you.

00:17:57.080 --> 00:17:58.630
Very well.

00:17:58.630 --> 00:18:01.650
This will provide some fun 
before I return to my wolf hunt!

00:18:07.890 --> 00:18:09.410
Shield bearers, form into ranks!

00:18:09.410 --> 00:18:12.740
Gather up any branches or roots 
you can find to help build a wall!

00:18:12.740 --> 00:18:14.720
We defend this mountain with our lives!

00:18:16.130 --> 00:18:19.070
We've driven them 
to the top of the mountain...

00:18:19.440 --> 00:18:21.960
Don't let a single one live!

00:18:22.900 --> 00:18:24.270
Don't wimp out on me.

00:18:24.270 --> 00:18:25.430
Stand.

00:18:26.160 --> 00:18:27.860
We're finished...

00:18:28.360 --> 00:18:31.940
Douen-sensei, run.

00:18:31.940 --> 00:18:34.270
Sorry, but I agree.

00:18:35.270 --> 00:18:39.400
Once I decide to save someone, 
I don't abandon them.

00:18:39.830 --> 00:18:42.020
I need to balance out 
my accounts, as well...

00:18:42.020 --> 00:18:43.400
Your accounts?

00:18:43.770 --> 00:18:48.190
I killed many people a long time ago.

00:18:48.750 --> 00:18:50.890
I can't escape what I've done,

00:18:50.890 --> 00:18:55.400
but I want to make up 
for it with the lives I save.

00:18:55.400 --> 00:18:58.520
Well, I won't ask what happened.

00:18:58.520 --> 00:18:59.820
There they are!

00:19:00.530 --> 00:19:01.450
They're here!

00:19:05.610 --> 00:19:06.710
Douen!

00:19:07.690 --> 00:19:09.700
S-Sensei?

00:19:11.440 --> 00:19:14.350
Everyone... live.

00:19:15.080 --> 00:19:18.700
Sensei! Sensei!

00:19:19.200 --> 00:19:21.240
<i>Those pieces of junk...</i>

00:19:22.490 --> 00:19:23.890
Fine.

00:19:23.890 --> 00:19:25.470
I'll fight you.

00:19:25.860 --> 00:19:28.890
Those pieces of shit 
aren't even real weapons.

00:19:28.890 --> 00:19:30.020
I'll tell you why...

00:19:30.740 --> 00:19:33.520
They miss. They give away your position.

00:19:33.520 --> 00:19:36.350
And they take forever to load!

00:19:41.440 --> 00:19:44.010
And they blow up in your face, too?

00:19:44.010 --> 00:19:45.360
They're worse than toys.

00:19:45.820 --> 00:19:49.350
The bow is the best ranged weapon there is.

00:19:50.760 --> 00:19:52.300
The smoke's turned everything white?

00:19:52.300 --> 00:19:54.020
Perfect for running.

00:19:57.140 --> 00:19:58.140
Shit!

00:20:05.480 --> 00:20:08.110
Like I just said...

00:20:08.790 --> 00:20:11.580
Nothing's better than a bo—

00:20:22.810 --> 00:20:24.200
Princess, get down!

00:20:25.110 --> 00:20:26.240
Gontarou!

00:20:26.630 --> 00:20:28.250
I'm fine...

00:20:28.250 --> 00:20:29.410
Don't take risks like that!

00:20:29.410 --> 00:20:31.030
Our lines are broken!

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:37.500
I'll show you the last pride 
of a man of the Sou clan!

00:21:04.830 --> 00:21:07.240
<i>No... This can't be happening...</i>

00:21:08.140 --> 00:21:10.060
<i>Everyone's dying.</i>

00:21:10.970 --> 00:21:13.760
<i>My clan... the islanders...</i>

00:21:13.760 --> 00:21:15.570
<i>They're all dying!</i>

00:21:20.590 --> 00:21:21.920
Everyone, listen to me!

00:21:21.920 --> 00:21:24.040
This way! Come this way!

00:21:25.820 --> 00:21:26.720
That voice...

00:21:27.200 --> 00:21:28.320
Jinzaburou!

00:21:28.320 --> 00:21:29.860
This is the escape route!

00:21:29.860 --> 00:21:31.420
You can climb down here!

00:21:31.750 --> 00:21:33.720
Jinzaburou is here!

00:21:35.180 --> 00:21:37.950
Everyone, run this way!

00:21:39.540 --> 00:21:41.580
Run until your legs fail!

00:21:41.580 --> 00:21:43.960
Just survive!

00:21:43.960 --> 00:21:45.040
More of them?

00:21:45.040 --> 00:21:45.980
How many?

00:21:45.980 --> 00:21:47.450
No more than a dozen.

00:21:47.450 --> 00:21:49.000
They're like mosquitoes.

00:21:52.210 --> 00:21:54.410
Don't let your guard down.

00:21:54.410 --> 00:21:56.490
One of them is a wasp.

00:21:57.570 --> 00:21:58.850
Everyone, run!

00:21:58.850 --> 00:22:01.650
He's holding our escape route open!

00:22:01.650 --> 00:22:03.040
<i>Just a little more...</i>

00:22:03.550 --> 00:22:06.300
<i>Just a little more, and I can see him!</i>

00:22:06.760 --> 00:22:08.250
<i>Just a little more!</i>

00:22:08.790 --> 00:22:10.800
<i>Just... another step!</i>

00:22:11.460 --> 00:22:12.640
Come on!

00:22:12.640 --> 00:22:14.220
Use it.

00:22:17.600 --> 00:22:18.540
Explosives!

00:22:18.540 --> 00:22:19.520
Everyone, get down!

00:22:25.570 --> 00:22:27.520
<i>Shit!</i>

00:22:32.010 --> 00:22:33.710
<i>Jinzaburou!</i>

00:22:37.210 --> 00:22:41.420
Jinzaburou!

00:22:39.750 --> 00:22:42.750
<b>Episode 11: 
The Sun God of Tsushima</b>
